'''Those Guys''' (例のヤツ, ''Rei no Yatsu'', '''Those Guys''') are a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appears in the [[Main Chapters Levels|Main Chapters]] and [[Legend Stages]]. They were added in [[Version 1.0 Update|Version 1.0]].

